WEBVTT

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.870
"Trains are currently delayed due to
an accident at Ogikubo Station."

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:11.200
"Trains are currently delayed due to
an accident at Ogikubo Station."
I'm sorry.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.620
I didn't mean to drag you into this.

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.660
Don't worry about it.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:20.660
I'll wait with you until
the trains resume service.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.450
Thank you very much.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.500
Oh... Hello?

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.620
Sorry, the trains are delayed.

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:32.540
But I'll be home soon.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:36.290
Yup... I'm fine. Thanks.

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:39.700
My little sister was worried about me.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.910
You have a younger sister?

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:45.250
Yes. I have three siblings.

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:48.450
What? I have three siblings, too!

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:53.870
Wow... I've never met anyone else
with three siblings before!

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.830
I feel very relieved now.

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:01.450
I just started school
and I still have a lot to learn.

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:05.370
I was worried about interning for Mr. Yanagida.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.290
I'm not confident about my skills
and experience with people.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:12.290
But now I have one less thing to worry about!

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:18.160
Miss Kokoro, are you aiming to become
both a model and a designer?

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:21.700
Huh?

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:24.200
Shoot, what am I saying?

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:28.700
That must be a very sensitive topic for her...

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:33.620
My dream... was to become a model...

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:39.620
But... I got really nervous
at my first fashion show.

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:42.500
Then, the brand's designer walked up to me...

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:47.250
Move your legs and walk normally
as if you were walking around town.

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:51.200
Let my clothes lead you down the runway.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.250
Yes...

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:55.660
Her words were so inspiring...

00:01:55.660 --> 00:02:00.700
She influenced me to dream
about becoming a designer.

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:02.120
That's why I enrolled at Geika.

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:07.660
That's amazing. That designer seems great, too.

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:08.870
May I ask who it was?

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:12.330
Oh. She's actually quite famous.

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:16.910
She was at the exhibition, too.
Her name is Mai Ayano.

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:20.580
Wait... The top designer...?!

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:24.830
Miss Kokoro's first fashion show

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:28.450
was for the top designer of Japan?!

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:31.910
She's my inspiration.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:36.040
Miss Kokoro... She must be
a truly talented model.

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:02.290
"Smile Down the Runway"

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:08.160
"Geika Fashion School"

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:09.290
"Geika Fashion School"
"Episode 5: Individual Styles"

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:11.500
"Episode 5: Individual Styles"
Welcome to the Geika Festival
information session.

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.370
Welcome to the Geika Festival
information session.

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:18.200
Let's get right into it, shall we?

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:23.750
I'd like to start by announcing
this year's grand prize.

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:26.250
The winner will receive support
to launch their own brand

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:29.200
and the opportunity to study abroad in Paris!

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.410
Wow.

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:35.290
That pretty much covers everything.

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:38.250
The preliminaries will start next week.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.290
That's all for today!

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:47.040
Paris... If I win... Even I could...

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.410
Oh, Ikuto!

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:49.370
Huh?

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:54.160
So, tell me about your helper, Kokoro.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.660
What do you mean?

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:59.500
She's not the strongest player, is she?

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.620
What?

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:03.660
But let me tell you. That girl's got potential.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:08.330
She masters everything she learns
by the next day.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:10.000
I see...

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:13.620
Take care of Kokoro for me, okay?

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:17.540
Just come with me.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.000
--You're done playing school.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.290
--I'm sorry... I'm sorry...!
--You're done playing school.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.370
Huh?

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:23.500
Quit acting like a brat!

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.450
Miss Kokoro?!

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:26.950
I'm sorry... I'm sorry...

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:27.660
--Don't think you can just apologize.

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.160
--What are you doing?!
--Don't think you can just apologize.

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:30.040
--What are you doing?!
--Huh?

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:35.620
Who the heck are you?

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:38.410
That's what I want to know. Who are you?!

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:40.080
That one...

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:42.620
I manage that model right there.

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:44.750
The manager...?!

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.250
Like I said, Hasegawa.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:52.910
This month... You have until
this month to quit this school.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.160
--What?!
--What?!

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.580
You can't make her quit!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.910
This is none of your business, kid.

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:01.040
That one... She's the hope of our agency.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:05.700
She's 181 cm tall and her
inside leg measures 93 cm.

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:08.410
She's our agency's treasured model.

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:13.040
We can't afford to let her
escape into a fantasy.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.330
It's impossible.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:17.330
You'll never be a designer.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:20.410
You're just pretending that you
want to be a designer

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:24.830
because you don't want to model anymore.

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:29.580
It's disrespectful to those who are actually
pursuing to become designers.

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:34.160
I'm... serious...

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:39.950
What...? If you have something to say,
tell me now.

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:45.950
I'm... sorry...

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:53.290
Miss Kokoro...

00:06:53.290 --> 00:06:54.290
Huh?

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.410
Huh? What's this...?!

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:08.580
Oh... Huh?

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:09.910
Is that it...?

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:14.830
I'm sorry you had to come all this way.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.120
Oh, it's no big deal.

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:22.040
Did you happen to read what I wrote inside?

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:25.080
Oh! I'm sorry... I...

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:26.660
Um...

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:32.620
When I first started at the model agency...

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:35.160
...I was scared of the other models.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:39.870
"When I look at you,
all my efforts seem pointless."

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.370
"Be happy you don't have to work hard."

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:45.500
They said those things to me at my first show.

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:48.910
I dreaded changing in front of everyone.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:52.450
My mind would draw a blank
when I sensed everyone's eyes on me.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.500
I was scared.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:55.620
That's why...

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.540
I couldn't deny it.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.120
You'll never be a designer.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:01.500
You're just pretending
that you want to be a designer.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:05.660
It's disrespectful to those who are
actually pursuing to become designers.

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:10.200
Oh... Huh?

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:13.000
What my manager said was right.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:18.950
If I liked being a model, maybe
I wouldn't want to be a designer.

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:23.290
I'm sorry.

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:25.200
Miss Kokoro.

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:27.580
Oh... Huh?

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:29.080
Ah!

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:32.660
But let me tell you. That girl's got potential.

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:38.200
She masters everything
she learns by the next day.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:42.040
Learn how to handle the Georgette.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:46.870
A busy month ahead.
Set aside time to make clothes.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:47.250
--Get used to draping!

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:50.040
--I don't understand the pattern of the dress
I wore at today's shoot! I need to study more.
--Get used to draping!

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:52.200
--I take too much time ironing pleats.
--My stitches aren't stable on soft fabrics.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:55.580
--Study up on page 104
in the "Fashion Design" textbook.
--The collar needs to open more beautifully
or else the outfit doesn't work.

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:58.870
--How can I make the drape look more beautiful?
--Don't be intimidated by Mr. Ayano.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:00.910
"I want to be a designer."

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:03.410
"I want to be a designer."
I want to be a designer.

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:09.450
Disrespectful...? Not at all.

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:15.540
Mr. Ikuto...?

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:16.580
Miss Kokoro!

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:17.500
Huh?

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.870
Let's participate in
the Geika Festival's fashion show!

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:22.000
What...?

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:27.410
We'll show your manager how talented you are
and that you're serious about it!

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:29.660
I'm sorry... I have a hard time following--

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:31.830
Aren't you frustrated?!

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:33.540
Being treated like that?!

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:39.580
Um... I can't find the words right now...

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:42.080
If you want to do something, you should!

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:46.250
If you want to be recognized,
you have to take that first step yourself.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:51.120
That's right. I learned that
from someone I respect.

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:53.910
Am I capable... of it...?

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:56.950
Absolutely! Let's show them!

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.160
Oh...!

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.500
I'll do it.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:04.450
I'll participate in the Geika Festival, too!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:05.540
"Hayasaka General Hospital"

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:08.200
"Hayasaka General Hospital"
Wow, you're going to be in a show, Ikuto?

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:10.410
I'm impressed!

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:11.790
I'll be rooting for you.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.540
Thanks.

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.000
Huh?

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.830
Your face... You look tired.

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:20.250
Maybe you're working too hard.

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:22.790
I wouldn't say that.

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:24.000
Is it tough?

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.950
Not at all.

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:27.620
Are you having fun?

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:28.750
Yup.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:30.000
It's really fun.

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:33.120
That's my boy!

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:35.000
Now off you go. You don't want to be late.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:38.500
You're right. I have to go now.

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:40.500
All right. You can do this!

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:41.910
I'll see you later!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:51.120
Ms. Tsumura, it's time for your screening.

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:52.700
"Geika Fashion School"

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:55.910
Today's the day.
It's the Geika Festival preliminaries.

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:59.750
Miss Kokoro, where's your test room?

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:02.200
I'm in Practice Room B.

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:05.870
I'm in Room E. We'll be in separate rooms.

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:08.540
Let's promise to do our best today!

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:09.370
Yes!

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:13.700
Oh?

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:19.540
Don't get too carried away now.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:23.000
It's the fitter from Tokyo Fashion Week...

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.910
Oh... It's you again.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:27.620
Kaoru, do you know him?

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:30.120
No... Not really.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:31.410
But...

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:33.200
He gets on my nerves.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:36.080
I'll take him down a peg or two.

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:42.330
What? Thought you weren't
that invested in the preliminaries.

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:45.200
She glared at me.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:47.330
But actually...

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.660
There's so much tension in this room.

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:52.410
Huh?

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:57.620
All right, have a seat, everyone.

00:11:57.620 --> 00:12:00.410
Take any seat that's open, hurry up.

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:02.620
I guess I'll take this seat.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:08.870
The 30 of you selected
to make women's clothing--

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:12.410
you'll work on your design
for the next two days.

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:16.700
Then, you'll be judged to see if you
make it into the second round.

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:19.500
Only a few get to proceed...

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:21.160
So here's your task.

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:26.540
Design an outfit for the 1/3 scale doll.

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:27.910
Oh...

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:31.290
Now... Onto the theme...

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:34.500
But before that,
I'll collect your participation fee.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:35.870
Put the 10,000 yen on top of your desk.

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:37.750
"Participation Fee"
Put the 10,000 yen on top of your desk.

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:42.950
Sorry... I could only scrape up 5,000 yen.

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:49.250
I can't take this. It's for living expenses.

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:55.080
Don't be ridiculous. This is your chance
to participate in a fashion show!

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.700
Have fun, okay?

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:01.000
Next.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.120
Oh?

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:04.830
That's a lot of change you've got there.

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:08.410
He must've gathered all the change
scattered around the house.

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:11.450
So desperate... I feel sorry for him.

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:14.080
Shut it. Money is money.

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:15.250
Huh?

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:21.290
Let's move on. We're wasting time.

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:22.250
Oh...

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:25.620
You're right. It's time to reveal the theme.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:28.950
Is this recording now?

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:31.830
Hey everyone! It's me, Sara!

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:35.120
Sara?! The famous model?!

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:41.450
I thought really hard about what
the theme should be for today.

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:45.790
But I decided to not think too hard
and kept it simple.

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.950
Your task is...

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:50.660
...to make a stylish outfit
that makes me look amazing!

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:52.250
What?!

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:56.370
Because we all know every girl
wants to look stylish all the time!

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:59.750
Now off you go! Good luck!

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.620
Stylish...?

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:04.700
This is a really hard task...

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:10.660
We don't know when, where, and for what
Miss Sara is thinking of wearing it.

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:15.040
You've got an hour to come up with a design.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:18.370
All right. Let the Geika Festival
preliminaries begin!

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.040
<i>Smile Down the Runway.</i>

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:30.450
Excuse me.

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:31.750
Huh?

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:35.910
Will you tell me that woman's name?

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:38.450
I wanted to thank her for standing up for me.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:44.000
Now I get why Kaoru's acting like that.

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.370
Huh?

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:48.200
Everyone here is your enemy.

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:52.540
But you've got the nerve to "thank" one?

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:54.540
You're annoyingly naive.

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:58.370
Oh... I see.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:00.410
We're all rivals here.

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:02.500
There's no need to be friendly.

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:08.040
But still... Will you tell me her name?

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:11.870
Being friendly and expressing gratitude
are different things.

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:14.790
Since she did stand up for me,

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:16.950
I want to thank her properly.

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:21.620
It's Kaoru... Kizaki.

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:23.700
Thank you very much.

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:25.200
And...

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:27.830
I feel so bad for him.

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:32.660
I won't let anyone feel bad for me again!

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:36.700
All right, time's up!

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.080
You're all off on your own now.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:42.540
Use the participation fee
of 10,000 yen as your budget

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.910
to purchase the fabric you need for your design.

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:46.950
Oh...

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:51.830
They don't come cheap, do they?

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:54.660
Oh, yeah. I told him your name, Kaoru.

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:55.540
What?

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:56.830
That was unnecessary.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:00.200
He really gets on your nerves, huh?

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:01.750
Not really...

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:05.040
I'm not just frustrated at him.

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:09.580
I'm frustrated at everyone who
destroyed Mr. Hajime's show.

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:11.250
I see.

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:12.700
Plus...

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:17.620
I'm not trying to stand in his way
or anything like that.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:21.660
I just want to defeat him fair and square.

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:28.040
What a relief. If the budget comes
from the participation fee,

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:31.200
I could get away with using just my money.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:34.620
I can give 5,000 yen back to Honoka.

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:38.410
This is the budget I have to make something
stylish in Miss Sara's eyes.

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:40.500
To make it work...

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:41.450
Oh?

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:44.830
I know!

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:50.700
Patchwork!

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:55.330
A method where you sew together various
pieces of fabric to form a design.

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:59.910
I can buy cheap scraps of fabric
and build my design with patchwork!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:00.950
It's my...

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:04.620
...so-called, specialty!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:10.080
This is the cheapest way!

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:18.660
Look, he's still here.

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:22.580
But why does he look so pale?

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:25.370
This outfit's not going to work.

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:30.910
It wasn't a bad idea.

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:34.500
But there was no way I could've
designed something

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:38.120
Miss Sara would like with fabric made
from cheap materials.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.870
Then, I better ask for help!

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:45.910
I hear you, phone...

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.500
Hello?

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.500
What's up, Ikuto?

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:53.000
I need to know everything about Miss Sara!

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:56.200
Oh?

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:57.660
Hey, hey.

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:59.750
Come in.

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:01.120
S-Sorry to bother you!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:02.120
Do you want slippers?

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:05.410
Huh? I-I'll leave that up to your imagination.

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:06.620
What?

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:12.750
She wears heels inside?

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:14.290
But wait a minute...

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:16.080
She's barely wearing anything!

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:20.500
Do you want to check out
Miss Sara's runway footage?

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:22.950
I recorded variety shows, too...

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:24.580
What do you want to start with?

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:25.580
Are you listening?

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:27.500
Huh? Oh... Y-Yes!

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:33.830
Let's start with the variety show.
That way, you'll see her transformation.

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:38.950
U-Um... Miss Chiyuki,
why do you wear heels at home?

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:41.700
I'm practicing getting used to it.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:44.120
All right. It's playing.

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:48.080
Sara, is it true that you choose
all the outfits you wear on TV?

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:53.500
I do! I think about fashion
24 hours a day--I can't help it.

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:58.120
Miss Sara is a celebrity, popular for her
easy-going and fun personality on TV.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:19:00.410
Of course not!

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:02.290
That's silly.

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:08.870
Apparently, she became popular
for her beauty and blunt comments.

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:10.950
Um... Miss Chiyuki...

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:12.830
Yeah? What is it?

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:13.700
Could you...

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:15.250
And... There!

00:19:18.620 --> 00:19:21.540
I can't concentrate at all!

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:24.040
Could you please stop that for now...?

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:26.830
No way. It's part of my daily training.

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:29.160
My eyes keep wandering...

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:31.620
What? Just focus on the TV.

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:33.410
That's true!

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:37.330
You get distracted because
you're not fully focused.

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:39.160
All right! One, two!

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:40.330
One, two!

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:42.870
This is pretty tough...

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:47.040
Miss Sara does this exercise
to maintain her figure, too.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:52.370
Miss Sara's always smiling
and making silly comments on TV...

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:57.620
The Miss Sara on TV is different
from the one I know.

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:02.040
I know her as a sophisticated and stoic model...

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:09.410
She's like an actor who plays different roles
through her walk on the runway.

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:15.410
Designers make clothes
for an ideal person in their mind.

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:19.450
The model's job is to embody
that ideal on the runway.

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:23.700
Of course, some models are known
for their powerful personality...

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:29.120
But some models manipulate their stride,
the movement of their arms, waist, shoulders,

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:32.450
and at times, even their head, masterfully...

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:38.000
...to achieve that ideal image
that the designer demands.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:41.950
But what's most impressive about Miss Sara...

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:46.910
...is how she can perform the same walk
with heels of all heights.

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:50.370
She acquired that ability
with a lot of training.

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:54.750
But why did she work so hard?

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:57.370
She's 171 cm tall.

00:20:57.370 --> 00:21:01.290
Which is considered short for a runway model.

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:04.450
She's a small model with world recognition.

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:09.370
I consider Miss Sara as the key to my path.

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:12.580
See? Look at her walk.

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:17.120
Down the middle of the rug
sprawled down the hallway...

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:22.540
She traces the straight line of imprints
perfectly as she walks with her heels.

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:27.370
If I compare her with
the elite model on the screen,

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:31.660
I see no difference with the performance

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:35.580
of this 158 cm model in front of me.

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:39.540
So, did you find anything that helped?

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:41.500
Y-Yes!

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:43.540
Thank you so much.

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:46.290
I didn't, to be honest.

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:50.000
Actually, if you don't mind me asking...

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:52.080
Are you traveling somewhere?

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:53.580
Oh.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:57.580
I was planning on going to Paris
on our next three-day weekend.

00:21:57.580 --> 00:21:59.660
Paris?

00:21:59.660 --> 00:22:04.200
Models have to put themselves
out there to get work.

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:06.830
So this is my way of taking action.

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:08.450
Amazing...

00:22:08.450 --> 00:22:13.660
I, on the other hand, can't seem
to get out of this creative block.

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:16.290
Miss Chiyuki...

00:22:16.290 --> 00:22:19.330
She's working so hard towards her dream...

00:22:22.120 --> 00:22:23.580
Ikuto...?

00:22:26.660 --> 00:22:29.620
Your face... You look tired.

00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:31.950
Maybe you're working too hard.

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:37.000
Ah!

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:39.620
Where did that come from all of a sudden?!

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:42.790
What? You're the one making that face.

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:43.750
Are you getting enough sleep?

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:46.410
Y-Y-Yes. I'm getting enough sleep!

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:48.410
And plus... Huh?

00:22:51.330 --> 00:22:52.620
What?

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:55.120
I got it...

00:22:55.120 --> 00:22:56.620
Huh?

00:22:56.620 --> 00:23:00.830
I got an idea!

00:24:31.370 --> 00:24:33.950
Next, "Superiority and Inferiority."

00:24:33.950 --> 00:24:36.910
"See you next time!!"
